{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1537219-it-s-official-i-am-abandoning-wod5","id":1537219,"title":"It's official - I am abandoning WOD5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-11T14:50:08-07:00","id":1537219,"title":"It's official - I am abandoning WOD5","content":"I know no one will care and it's hardly a thing I should care about but I am leaving V5 behind and returning permanently to V20 with the only exception being incorporating the lore from the Onyx Path publishing books for V5. I've long been a cheerleader for V5 and was a defender of this when they were otherwise very unpopular but I just can't continue onward and I'm not sure I'm even going to buy any more V5 material other than the Visual Novels and Bloodlines.<br /> <br /> Why?<br /> <br /> It's the handling of Legacy.<br /> <br /> The reason I came back to V:TM was because of the announcement it was going to be the Old World of Darkness revived. I liked what OPP to save the license with V20 but never really jived with the &quot;metaplot agnostic&quot; approach and it was only when they adjusted that I changed my view on things. BECKETT'S JYHAD DIARY remained the absolute greatest book ever written for V:TM and celebrated everything I loved about the setting.<br /> <br /> I also came back for CBN and its spin off titles, spending way too much money (money well spent) on the Kickstarter. Same for Cults of the Blood Gods.<br /> <br /> But the decisions for WoD5 are now exactly the opposite of what I loved.<br /> <br /> Less and less metaplot, less and less NPCs, less and less lore.<br /> <br /> W5 should have been the death blow to my idealism with the hints that W:TA 1-20 were now non-canon and irreconcilable but I stubbornly denied what was in front of my face. I should have known you can only trust people with a genuine love of the material. I don't get that feeling outside of the livestream games.<br /> <br /> So from now on, it'll just be cherishing what OPP has already made and Storyteller's Vault material.<br /> <br /> You guys were right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":24},{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T14:57:19-07:00","id":1537220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1537219-it-s-official-i-am-abandoning-wod5#post1537219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know no one will care and it's hardly a thing I should care about but I am leaving V5 behind and returning permanently to V20 with the only exception being incorporating the lore from the Onyx Path publishing books for V5. I've long been a cheerleader for V5 and was a defender of this when they were otherwise very unpopular but I just can't continue onward and I'm not sure I'm even going to buy any more V5 material other than the Visual Novels and Bloodlines.<br /> <br /> Why?<br /> <br /> It's the handling of Legacy.<br /> <br /> The reason I came back to V:TM was because of the announcement it was going to be the Old World of Darkness revived. I liked what OPP to save the license with V20 but never really jived with the &quot;metaplot agnostic&quot; approach and it was only when they adjusted that I changed my view on things. BECKETT'S JYHAD DIARY remained the absolute greatest book ever written for V:TM and celebrated everything I loved about the setting.<br /> <br /> I also came back for CBN and its spin off titles, spending way too much money (money well spent) on the Kickstarter. Same for Cults of the Blood Gods.<br /> <br /> But the decisions for WoD5 are now exactly the opposite of what I loved.<br /> <br /> Less and less metaplot, less and less NPCs, less and less lore.<br /> <br /> W5 should have been the death blow to my idealism with the hints that W:TA 1-20 were now non-canon and irreconcilable but I stubbornly denied what was in front of my face. I should have known you can only trust people with a genuine love of the material. I don't get that feeling outside of the livestream games.<br /> <br /> So from now on, it'll just be cherishing what OPP has already made and Storyteller's Vault material.<br /> <br /> You guys were right.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, I think I agree with you. I didn\u2019t buy Bloodstained Love and I\u2019m probably not going to buy any of the other books they have coming out this year for V5, or any of the books at all for W5. I might buy Alma Maters for Hunter just because I like the subject matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T14:59:24-07:00","id":1537221,"title":"","content":"At least we still have the Onyx Path Forums \ud83d\ude0a. I really like it here, the people are great and I have no plans on leaving.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":9},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T15:06:17-07:00","id":1537222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1537219-it-s-official-i-am-abandoning-wod5?p=1537220#post1537220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sadly, I think I agree with you. I didn\u2019t buy Bloodstained Love and I\u2019m probably not going to buy any of the other books they have coming out this year for V5, or any of the books at all for W5. I might buy Alma Maters for Hunter just because I like the subject matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's the thing, I didn't DISLIKE Bloodstained Love but it isn't what I was looking for in a supplement. It told me what the new design philosophy going forward would be.<br /> <br /> * Generic stats for NPCs, &quot;Prostitute&quot;, &quot;Pimp&quot;, &quot;Moon Eyed Vampire Fan&quot;<br /> * NPCs divorced of cities, nations, or context<br /> * No connection to the Legacy characters<br /> * De-emphasized Lore<br /> <br /> Victoria Ash is the only thing leftover from the setting and she doesn't even get any lore sheets, let alone a stat write-up. It was just....sad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T15:06:40-07:00","id":1537223,"title":"","content":"I think that I have more than enough Vampire The Masquerade books to suit my needs. With Players Guide and the older sourcebooks we have in our collection to help out. We can't see much need for the others that got published.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T15:09:02-07:00","id":1537224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1537219-it-s-official-i-am-abandoning-wod5?p=1537223#post1537223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that I have more than enough Vampire The Masquerade books to suit my needs. With Players Guide and the older sourcebooks we have in our collection to help out. We can't see much need for the others that got published.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, for me, the problem is I was never in it for the rules so much as the characters and seeing how they evolve.<br /> <br /> I actually really enjoyed the New York visual novels and LA by Night primarily because they showed how the settings changed from the books.<br /> <br /> Knowing that's never going to happen again is sad. Lucita and Jan Pieterszoon may be dead or they may be not but they'll never have a big role in the books again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-11T15:10:54-07:00","id":1537225,"title":"","content":"i'll miss you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://foru